      "writtenOn": "2024-01-30T14:42:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Shim layer registers callback to be called when interrupt occurs (using `fingerprint_config()`). `fingerprint_run_callback()` is a syscall provided by sensor simulator that calls this callback. As a result we set fpsensor task as \"ready to run\" here.",
