      "writtenOn": "2024-01-30T14:42:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We can get check fpsensor mode using following code:\n```\nparams.mode \u003d FP_MODE_DONT_CHANGE;\nzassert_ok(ec_cmd_fp_mode(NULL, \u0026params, \u0026response));\nzassert_false(response.mode \u0026 FP_MODE_CAPTURE);\n```\n\nDon\u0027t forget that `fingerprint_set_state()` is used to manipulate sensor simulator state, not the fpsensor state.",
